{"seq":3,"slug":"swaraj","title":"自治与自我","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/swaraj","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-meaning-of-swaraj","title":"自治的含义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/swaraj/the-meaning-of-swaraj","wordCount":1932,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"simple-living-and-self-discipline","title":"简朴生活与自律","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/swaraj/simple-living-and-self-discipline","wordCount":1867,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"自治与自我\">自治与自我</h1><p>&quot;自治&quot;（Swaraj），是甘地崇高的自由理想。本章考察其丰富内涵。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;自治的含义&quot;——它如何超越政治独立，融合道德自律与经济自立。第二篇文档讲述&quot;简朴生活与自律&quot;,呈现他知行合一、为世人树立的道德榜样。</p>\n"}